(1) The system requires the record for audit purposes.
(2) The record is referenced by other records. E.g., you cannot delete a Business Partner, if there are invoices for this partner record existing. You de-activate the Business Partner and prevent that this record is used for future entries.',Updated=TO_TIMESTAMP('2016-02-26 10:00:53','YYYY-MM-DD HH24:MI:SS'),IsTranslated='Y' WHERE AD_Field_ID=10289 AND AD_Language='en_US'
;

